{"id":"1929183905371619597","kind":"article","title":"绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3J3QxG3TkZfqkKWTx9cBvi"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2025-07-19","updated":"2025-07-20","votes":10,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":329,"keywords":["概念图","检索练习","内隐提取练习","学习研究"],"summary":"作者原本预期绘制概念图会触发内隐检索练习，但指出 Karpicke 与 Blunt（2011）及 Kornell（2012）的研究没有发现这一结果。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1929183905371619597","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"QlBZnl0z\">按理说，我会预期绘制概念图这项活动能触发<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zQGck6tJtxXKa79HWtsV9LT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">内隐提取练习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，然而 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zFUBZG5yY1aKJ4hpak2jWPA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Karpicke 与 Blunt (2011) 的研究</a>发现事实并非如此，Kornell (2012) 的研究也得出了同样的结论（该研究被 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zV1xNteVY4otyHP5gCcanVN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Agarwal 等人 (2021) 在其系统性综述中所引用</a>）。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"HvaxwZ-D\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1928747456914515370\" href=\"#/post/1928747456914515370\">内隐提取练习</a></li><li data-pid=\"FulBiVtQ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1930200421491803500\" href=\"#/post/1930200421491803500\">绘制概念图</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"Yu6lrJBQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-2.5-pro，校